        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "趟: count actions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "趟 after a travel verb counts trips. It measures journeys rather than the vehicles used.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我去了一趟北京。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ qù le yī tàng Běijīng 。",
                "meaning": "I made one trip to Beijing.",
                "audio": "c8bb892888bb977475ad5d79f138a7aaabefe6c6af7cc708d686383afb001b45"
              },
              {
                "text": "他跑了两趟。",
                "pinyin": "tā pǎo le liǎng tàng 。",
                "meaning": "He made two trips.",
                "audio": "c84cd491a94630ef5658b4af1c68d619270742a020c480142b74a80af82cb0d7"
              }
            ]
          },
